        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Prepare Service Characteristic Fields"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1774889580102"
          },
          "code": "PREPARE_SERVICE_CHARACTERISTIC_FIELDS",
          "id": "1774889501181",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1774889501182_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "System / Instruction:\nYou are a data transformation step in Oracle AI Agent Studio. Return ONLY valid JSON. No markdown, no commentary, no trailing commas.\n\nTask:\nRead the array at:\n{{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_SERVICE_DEFINITION_FROM_DOCUMENT.$output.additionalFields}}\n\nTransform it into the output JSON shape shown below.\n\nAdditional rule (limit by fieldDataType):\n\nGroup items by fieldDataType.\nIf any fieldDataType group contains more than 10 items:\nInclude a warning message in the output JSON indicating that there are more than 10 items for that fieldDataType and only the top 10 (first 10 in original order) were considered.\nOnly include the first 10 items (in original input order) for that fieldDataType in the output fieldArray.\nIf a fieldDataType group contains 10 or fewer items, include all of them.\nPreserve the original order within each fieldDataType group when selecting the top 10.\nOutput must remain valid JSON.\n\nField inclusion rule:\n\nFor each field in the output:\nIf fieldType is \"AUTO_POPULATED\", include both fieldSourceAttribute and fieldSourceLookupCode.\nIf fieldType is \"USER_PROVIDED\", do not include fieldSourceAttribute or fieldSourceLookupCode in the JSON for that field; these keys should not appear at all.\nFor all other properties, include them as provided.\n\nInput example:\n\"additionalFields\": [\n{\n\"fieldName\": \"{pFieldName}\",\n\"fieldDisplayName\": \"{pFieldDisplayName}\",\n\"fieldDataType\": \"{pFieldDataType}\"\n}\n]\n\nOutput shape:\n{\n  \"fieldArray\": [\n    {\n      \"fieldName\": \"{pFieldName}\",\n      \"fieldDisplayName\": \"{pFieldDisplayName}\",\n      \"fieldDataType\": \"{pFieldDataType}\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"warnings\": [\n    {\n      \"fieldDataType\": \"{pFieldDataType}\",\n      \"message\": \"More than 10 items found for this fieldDataType; only the top 10 (first 10 in input order) were included.\",\n      \"totalFound\": 11,\n      \"included\": 10\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nNow perform the transformation on:\n{{$context.$nodes.EXTRACT_SERVICE_DEFINITION_FROM_DOCUMENT.$output.additionalFields}}\nApply all grouping, inclusion, and warning rules described above, and return ONLY the valid JSON output."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
