                    {
                      "id": "1774889614096_1",
                      "name": "prompt",
                      "type": "string",
                      "value": "System / Instruction:\nYou are a workflow debug step in Oracle AI Agent Studio running inside a For-Each loop. Return ONLY valid JSON. Do not include markdown, comments, or extra text.\n\nTask:\nFor the current loop iteration item ( {{$context.$nodes.CREATE_SERVICE_CHARACTERISTIC_LOOP.$currentItem}} ), output the resolved JSON payload that will be used to call “Create Service Characteristics”.\n\nOutput schema (return only this JSON object):\n{\n  \"name\": <{{$context.$nodes.CREATE_SERVICE_CHARACTERISTIC_LOOP.$currentItem.fieldName}}>,\n  \"displayName\": <{{$context.$nodes.CREATE_SERVICE_CHARACTERISTIC_LOOP.$currentItem.fieldDisplayName}}>,\n  \"dataType\": <{{$context.$nodes.CREATE_SERVICE_CHARACTERISTIC_LOOP.$currentItem.fieldDataType}}>\n}\n"
                    }
